OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'beyond heartbroken' after
OL,4,Afatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an 18-year-old who was
OL,7,Fkilled in a car crash said their world
OL,8,Fwould "never be the same again".
OL,10,FAcacia Barnett was a passenger in a red
OL,11,FFord Fiesta that hit a tree near the
OL,12,Fjunction of Horns Lane and Lane End
OL,13,FRoad in High Wycombe on 3 September.
OL,14,FShe has been formally identified by the
OL,15,FBuckinghamshire coroner.
OL,17,FHer family said they were "beyond
OL,18,Fheartbroken at the tragic loss of
OL,19,F[their] beautiful Acacia", who had an
OL,20,F"amazing sense of humour".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
